# Phase 1 Supabase foundation — build-time client variables only.
#
# Copy the two lines below into your real .env as needed once connected.
# These are BROWSER-SAFE by design (anon/publishable key + RLS is what
# protects the data, same model as any other Supabase app).
#
# NEVER put SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY, a DB connection string, or any admin
# token in this file, in any file with a VITE_ prefix, or anywhere under
# client/ — those belong only in Supabase Edge Function secrets
# (`supabase secrets set ...`), which never ship to the browser or into Git.
#
# Phase 1 does not read these yet: client/src/main.tsx, useAuth.ts, and the
# tRPC provider are untouched, so the existing Manus-OAuth-backed screens work
# exactly as before whether or not these variables are set.

VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
